{
  "slug": "claude-token-stats",
  "name": "Claude Token Stats",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Track token usage and cost for every Claude Code session. Automatically captures input tokens, output tokens, cache usage, and calculates real cost per prompt using model-specific pricing (Opus, Sonnet, Haiku). Shows running totals and per-model breakdown. Includes a native macOS menu bar app with a live dashboard.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install claude-token-stats@claude-community` from `sabahkemalcansu/claude-token-stats`.\n\nTrack token usage and cost for every Claude Code session. Native macOS menu bar app with real-time stats.\n\nTrack token usage and cost for every Claude Code session. Automatically captures input tokens, output tokens, cache usage, and calculates real cost per prompt using model-specific pricing (Opus, Sonnet, Haiku). Shows running totals and per-model breakdown. Includes a native macOS menu bar app with a live dashboard.",
